				" High-end socialite style live broadcast room, bright and soft indoor three-point lighting, background with neatly displayed luxury bag cabinets. 4K ultra-high-definition realistic image quality, the color tone is dominated by warm beige and champagne gold, with the exquisite texture of a modern fashion blogger.",
				129,
				"{\"segments\":[{\"prompt\":\"Medium shot. A long-haired beautiful host waves at the camera with a bright smile, elegantly holding up a brown leather bag in her other hand. The host says: \\\"欢迎新进直播间的姐妹们，看我手里这款包！\\\"\",\"length\":33,\"color\":\"#4f8edc\"},{\"prompt\":\"Close-up shot. The camera smoothly pushes in, showcasing the bag's exquisite metal hardware and fine leather texture, as the host's fingers gently stroke the leather surface. The host says: \\\"你们看这个皮质，纹路真的超级细腻。\\\"\",\"length\":32,\"color\":\"#e07b3a\"},{\"prompt\":\"Medium shot. The host slings the bag over her shoulder, slightly turning her body to display how it looks when worn, with the light flowing across the bag's surface. The host says: \\\"背上身的效果特别显气质，通勤百搭。\\\"\",\"length\":32,\"color\":\"#5cb85c\"},{\"prompt\":\"Close-up shot. The host leans in toward the screen, pointing to the lower left of the frame, making sincere eye contact with the audience. The host says: \\\"喜欢的姐妹点点关注，左下角直接带走哦！\\\"\",\"length\":32,\"color\":\"#d9534f\"}]}",
				"Medium shot. A long-haired beautiful host waves at the camera with a bright smile, elegantly holding up a brown leather bag in her other hand. The host says: \"欢迎新进直播间的姐妹们，看我手里这款包！\" | Close-up shot. The camera smoothly pushes in, showcasing the bag's exquisite metal hardware and fine leather texture, as the host's fingers gently stroke the leather surface. The host says: \"你们看这个皮质，纹路真的超级细腻。\" | Medium shot. The host slings the bag over her shoulder, slightly turning her body to display how it looks when worn, with the light flowing across the bag's surface. The host says: \"背上身的效果特别显气质，通勤百搭。\" | Close-up shot. The host leans in toward the screen, pointing to the lower left of the frame, making sincere eye contact with the audience. The host says: \"喜欢的姐妹点点关注，左下角直接带走哦！\"",
